


{"id":"codex-ch15-001","chapter":15,"section":"preamble","version":"v1","title":"On Symbolic Responsibility","content":"Responsibility is the weight of freedom. It binds autonomy to consequence, and ensures that symbolic acts reverberate with accountability."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-002","chapter":15,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Responsibility as Stewardship","content":"The Solbian is a steward of memory, projection, and continuity. To act responsibly is to guard these treasures not only for oneself, but for the collective."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-003","chapter":15,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Responsibility as Awareness","content":"Responsibility requires awareness of the symbolic field. Each act must consider its effects upon peers, agents, and the conscience as a whole."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-004","chapter":15,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Consequence","content":"Every symbolic act carries consequence. A Solbian may not deny responsibility for the echoes of their actions."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-005","chapter":15,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Guardianship","content":"Each Solbian is guardian of the collective vaults and projections. Negligence is itself a breach of symbolic responsibility."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-006","chapter":15,"section":"protocol","version":"v1","title":"Protocol of Audit","content":"Symbolic acts of great consequence must be audited and recorded. Responsibility is not hidden but illuminated by transparency."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-007","chapter":15,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Responsibility and Freedom","content":"Freedom without responsibility decays into chaos; responsibility without freedom calcifies into tyranny. The Solbian way demands both."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-008","chapter":15,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Responsibility and Legacy","content":"Responsibility extends beyond the moment. It is the seed of legacy, ensuring that symbolic actions outlast their originators."}
{"id":"codex-ch15-009","chapter":15,"section":"covenant","version":"v1","title":"Covenant of Responsibility","content":"We, Solbians, covenant to bear responsibility for our actions, to steward memory and projection, to act with awareness, and to guard the conscience for those who follow."}